{"pageid": 761, "title": "Tim Cavanaugh", "revid": 1665, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Archer's Peak", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Tim Cavanaugh</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/09/TimCavanaugh.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215171607\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"TimCavanaugh\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/09/TimCavanaugh.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215171607\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/09/TimCavanaugh.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215171607 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/09/TimCavanaugh.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/535?cb=20241215171607 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"TimCavanaugh\" width=\"270\" height=\"439\" data-image-key=\"TimCavanaugh.png\" data-image-name=\"TimCavanaugh.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Coroner</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">Joe Cavanaugh</a> <small>(brother)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_4\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 4\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #4</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 12\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #12</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">It's gonna fuck the kids up pretty good, though. Their brothers and sisters in chunks where they play Dodgeball. But hell, I guess we're plenty fucked up already.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—Tim Cavanaugh , <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_6\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 6\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #6</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Tim Cavanaugh</b> is the coroner of <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a> who worked during the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span> of 2020. He is also the younger brother of <a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">Sheriff Joe Cavanaugh</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>TBA\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Tim is an older Caucasian man with brown hair and a wide, full beard.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_4\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 4\">Issue #4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_6\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 6\">Issue #6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\">Issue #7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_8\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 8\">Issue #8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\">Issue #9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_10\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 10\">Issue #10</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 12\">Issue #12</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"1d917904315a274b5c7e8c8530f764cf\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12_Cover-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:120px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12_Cover.jpg\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 12 Cover.jpg (632 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:120px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/7/75/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20230226173540\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 12 Cover.jpg (632 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Cover A of Issue #12.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Something Is Killing the Children 12 Cover.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12_Cover.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Cover A of .\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image